# Tool input validation

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Issue | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
| Status | Draft |

The registry enforces the same JSON Schema supplied to providers before any tool executor receives model input.

## Contract

- "'`execute` returns a descriptive `ToolResponse` for missing required fields, wrong types and invalid enum members without invoking the executor; rejection text and logs identify paths and constraints without exposing input values, while valid inputs retain extra keys, types and absent defaults unchanged and unknown tool names still throw `Unknown tool: <name>`.
- Static schemas compile at registration, with invalid schemas throwing an error naming the tool then; ten later executions reuse the compiled schema without traversing it again.
